        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/zalrus9/{size}/2124_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-06T05:28:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Very good list! I agree with all of your choices, although I feel that all of the villians are thematic on some level. From having a survival horror experience with Spite that turns into a giant showdown with a drug-wracked monstrosity, to fighting a mobile factory that keeps bristling with guns and spawning smaller drones, to fighting an evil version of a hero. It's all there!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The only exeption is that it's hard to see The Chairman as being in other places. Mainly, Atlantis.... What's his game? I'm on to you...</p>",
